<code>assert !Objects.isNull(c) => this.size() == c.size() && \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < this.size(); this.get(i).equals(c.toArray()[i]);</code>
--------------------
<code>assert !Objects.isNull(c) => this.containsAll(c) && c.containsAll(this);</code>
--------------------
<code>assert !c.equals(null) => this.containsAll(c) && c.containsAll(this) && this.size() == c.size();</code>
